{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今発売中の BOMB１月号で、\nよゐこ有野さん連載の「棚からボム餅」の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月の気になる有野的\nアイドルランキングにて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上が  ２位  にランクイン\nされておりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座います！嬉しいです（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも、乃木坂４６が\n特集されたりしているので、\nBOMBさん、是非見てみて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、一昨日発売の\nＣＤ&ＤＬでーたさんにも、\n私たちが載っています(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、井上はインタビューにも\n答えさせて頂きました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、出身地別のとこに\n私の名前が、、あれ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれあれ？ 載ってない（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当に埼玉県出身ですよ（ ;  ; ）\n空から降ってきてないよ～！\n天使じゃないです(x_x)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、かずみんに笑われてしまった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそれから、先日の\n乃木坂ってどこ？見てくださった方、\n有難う御座います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に、ロケ頑張りました、という記事を\n書いたのを覚えてますでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、あのロケというのが\nこれだったんです！＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送では使われませんでしたが、\nお化け屋敷で泣いてしまって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖くて怖くて、泣きすぎて\n過呼吸になりました（ ;  ; ）笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に怖かったです（ ;  ; ）（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばけ苦手です、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、お化け屋敷\n好きですか？？(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、大好きなかずみんとの\n写メでばいばい ○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/17/photo_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}